  "date": "2026-10-27",
  "decisions": [
    "Route the five SimpleRegionAPI layer/color methods to LayeredRegion from pinned Wowless documentation; Frame keeps common Region and ModelScene keeps its own one-argument setter. Existing VectorGraphics capabilities remain unchanged.",
    "Replace erased any and false opaque-userdata placeholders for arbitrary values with compiler unknown. Preserve every native symbol and every public/secure ambient global.",
    "Unspecified callable identity is unknown; it confers no invocation contract. Known callback signatures retain argument/result positions.",
    "Preserve typed callback varargs and their actual generic relationship; string securecall lookup has opaque results. Unbound external result generics use established bounds or unknown rather than caller-selected results.",
    "Native table source prose supports map/array key and value relationships and identity-preserving freeze; explicit known return secrecy remains unchanged. Record-preserving table generics and heterogeneous packs remain precision limits.",
    "StatusBar and RadialProgress literal factory overloads are supported by recorded owned native observations; existing generic Animation overload remains.",
    "Call policy is generated from finalized native contracts, includes receiver/ABI/variadic coordinates and canonical guard identities; automatic recursive input-contents grants are empty."
  ],
